TI  - Changes in patient-reported outcomes and objective assessments based on baseline symptom severity in SURMOUNT-OSA: post-hoc analyses.
AU  - Kanu Chisom
AU  - Shinde Shraddha
AU  - Falcon Beverly
AU  - Bednarik Josef
AU  - Xie Cathy Chang
AU  - Trice Kevin
